Gates only on what the dispatch reaches: SessionNotification, which a method
carries, holds the gated SessionUpdate and has gates; Archive holds it too,
but no method's params or result reach it, so it has none. Batch holds the
gated SessionUpdate and is reached only by the batch_update variant's allOf,
which the merge flattens into SessionBatchUpdate: that has gates and Batch
none, where ConfigOptionUpdate, reached the same way, had a gates no call
reached (0049-PLAN-tooling-fixes.md, phases 5 and 6, F-C).

